# The marketing site at caventia.com lives at the repo root. The
# product engineering code lives under apps/, packages/, infra/ and
# tools/ for the (in-progress) monorepo migration. Excluding those
# trees from the Vercel build prevents the marketing TypeScript pass
# from trying to type-check files that depend on workspace packages
# the marketing site does not install.
#
# See docs/MONOREPO.md for the full migration plan. Once the
# marketing site is moved into apps/marketing/, this file goes away
# and Vercel deploys from apps/marketing/ specifically.

apps/
packages/
infra/
tools/

# Working drafts and rendered intermediates
tasks/whitepapers/sr11-7-rendered.html
tasks/animations/

# IDE / OS noise
.idea/
.DS_Store
